
flowchart TD
    A[User opens app] --> B{Logged in?}
    B -- No --> C[Register or Login]
    C --> D[Dashboard: total balance + wallets + recent transactions]
    B -- Yes --> D

    D --> E[Click a currency wallet, e.g. USD]
    E --> F["Currency page: GET /wallets/USD + GET /transactions?currency=USD"]
    F -.->|no transactions| F1[Empty state: No transactions yet]
    F --> G[Click Exchange button]

    G --> H["Show exchangeable currencies: GET /currencies, excluding USD"]
    H --> I[Select target currency, e.g. EUR]
    I --> J[Enter amount]
    J --> K[GET /exchange-rates: live indicative rate]
    K --> L[POST /exchange-quotes]

    L --> M{Valid?}
    M -- SAME_CURRENCY / INVALID_AMOUNT --> J
    M -- INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE --> N[Show: Insufficient USD balance]
    N --> J
    M -- OK --> O[Review screen: locked rate, fee, amount received, 60s TTL]

    O --> P{User confirms within TTL?}
    P -- Expires --> Q[QUOTE_EXPIRED - request new quote]
    Q --> L
    P -- Cancels --> I
    P -- Confirms --> R[POST /exchanges with Idempotency-Key]

    R --> S{Idempotency-Key seen before?}
    S -- Yes --> T[200: return original result, no re-execution]
    S -- No --> U[DB transaction: lock wallets, re-check balance, debit source, credit destination]

    U --> V{Re-check passes?}
    V -- INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE --> N
    V -- QUOTE_ALREADY_CONSUMED --> W[Show: quote already used]
    V -- OK --> X[Insert Transaction, status COMPLETED]

    X --> Y[201: success + updated balances]
    T --> Y
    Y --> Z[Back to currency page - both wallets and histories refreshed]
